### 음식 이미지 업로드 presigned-url 생성 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/meals/images/presigned-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileSizeBytes": 1000
}

### 발급받은 presigned url로 이미지 S3에 업로드
PUT https://nyummy-app-bucket-455615001241-ap-northeast-2-an.s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/temp/6fc32947-0dd9-450e-a2ad-172c87d54aa5.jpg?
    x-id=PutObject&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&
    X-Amz-Credential=AKIAWUFGFGKM4PNRWFHW%2F20260729%2Fap-northeast-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260729T071208Z&
    X-Amz-Expires=600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=content-type%3Bhost&
