< image/crazy_spicy.jpeg


### 식사기록 생성 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "crazy_spicy",
  "imageKey": "temp/6fc32947-0dd9-450e-a2ad-172c87d54aa5.jpg",
  "mealAt": "2026-07-20T07:12:26Z",
  "iconId": 1
}

### 분석 상태 조회 API
@mealId = 10
GET {{url}}/api/v1/meals/{{mealId}}/analysis

### 재분석 요청 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/meals/{{mealId}}/analysis